OL,3,ATrump says Kennedy Center will shutter
OL,4,A'immediately', as judge rules his name
OL,5,Amust stay off building
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Kennedy Center board has voted to
OL,8,Fclose the performing arts centre for
OL,9,Ftwo years, just as a US judge blocked
OL,10,Fit from adding President Donald Trump's
OL,11,Fname back to the building.
OL,13,FIn May, the same judge ordered the
OL,14,Fremoval of Trump's name and blocked its
OL,15,Ftemporary closure for proposed
OL,16,Frenovations
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,166,160,200,105,0,100
