OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump says Kennedy Center will shutter
OL,4,A'immediately', as judge rules his name
OL,5,Amust stay off building
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe board, which is chaired by Trump
OL,8,Fand comprises his cabinet members and
OL,9,Fallies, approved a resolution in August
OL,10,Fthat called for the inscription
OL,11,F"Renovated and Restored by President
OL,12,FDonald J. Trump" to be added to the
OL,13,Fvenue.
OL,15,FTrump announced the addition of his
OL,16,Fname to the institution, among other
OL,17,Frebranding measures across the nation's
OL,18,Fcapital, last year.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
